Auth (Cloudflare Access, replaces Entra)
- Backend verifies Cf-Access-Jwt-Assertion (team domain almondfinancial.cloudflareaccess.com + this backend's own AUD).
- Worker calls the backend with its service token and forwards X-User-Email (optional X-User-Name); trusted only when the verified token's common_name equals Access:ServiceTokenClientId.
- To confirm: the backend needs its own Access application (own AUD, not the Worker's), the service token must be allowed on it, Worker must send the X-User-* headers, and service-token JWTs must carry common_name as assumed.
- Access:Audience and Access:ServiceTokenClientId are empty in appsettings; the app refuses to start without Audience.
